title: Wassily Kandinsky
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Russian painter. One of the first to paint with no subject at all.

Taught at the [[BauHaus]] from 1922 until it closed in 1933.

Wrote //Concerning the Spiritual in Art// and //Point and Line to Plane//.

[[Marcel Breuer]]'s tubular steel chair is called the [[Wassily Chair]] after him.

